@startuml
title Expense and Receipt Data Flow (proposed)
actor Submitter
participant "Client" as Client
participant "Expense service" as Service
database "Transactional records" as DB
collections "Private receipt store" as Files
participant "Outbox worker" as Worker
participant "Notification channel" as Notify
Submitter -> Client : expense fields + optional receipt
Client -> Service : authenticated submission
Service -> Service : authorize and validate membership/split
opt Receipt attached
 Service -> Files : stage private object
 Files --> Service : storage reference
end
Service -> DB : atomic expense + shares + approval state + notice intent
DB --> Service : commit
Service --> Client : pending result; no balance effect
Worker -> DB : fetch committed notice intent
Worker -> Notify : deduplicated delivery to other members
Notify --> Worker : delivered / retryable failure
opt Persistence fails after receipt stage
 Service -> Files : compensate/delete staged object
end
note over DB,Worker
Financial transaction commits before notification delivery.
Notification failure cannot roll back committed records.
Reconcile orphan receipts and retry outbox items.
end note
@enduml
